# =============================================================================
# SDGE Automated Governance CODEOWNERS (With Backup / Deputy Approver)
# Prevents CTO bottleneck and satisfies SOC 2 Segregation of Duties (when the
# CTO writes code, @deputy-lead-handle can review & approve the CTO's PR).
# Replace @cto-handle and @deputy-lead-handle with your actual GitHub usernames.
# =============================================================================

# 1. Dependency Lock (Hard Gate)
package.json                    @cto-handle @deputy-lead-handle
package-lock.json               @cto-handle @deputy-lead-handle
pnpm-lock.yaml                  @cto-handle @deputy-lead-handle
yarn.lock                       @cto-handle @deputy-lead-handle
pyproject.toml                  @cto-handle @deputy-lead-handle
requirements*.txt               @cto-handle @deputy-lead-handle
uv.lock                         @cto-handle @deputy-lead-handle
poetry.lock                     @cto-handle @deputy-lead-handle
pubspec.yaml                    @cto-handle @deputy-lead-handle
pubspec.lock                    @cto-handle @deputy-lead-handle

# 2. AI Context & Governance Files
/AGENTS.md                      @cto-handle @deputy-lead-handle
/.github/                       @cto-handle @deputy-lead-handle
/.gemini/                       @cto-handle @deputy-lead-handle
/.cursorrules                   @cto-handle @deputy-lead-handle
/CLAUDE.md                      @cto-handle @deputy-lead-handle
/.pre-commit-config.yaml        @cto-handle @deputy-lead-handle

# 3. Database Migrations & Schemas
**/prisma/schema.prisma         @cto-handle @deputy-lead-handle
**/migrations/**                @cto-handle @deputy-lead-handle
**/alembic/**                   @cto-handle @deputy-lead-handle

# 4. API & Event Contracts
**/contracts/**                 @cto-handle @deputy-lead-handle
**/*.openapi.yaml               @cto-handle @deputy-lead-handle
**/*.openapi.json               @cto-handle @deputy-lead-handle
**/*.schema.json                @cto-handle @deputy-lead-handle
